       CALL-ZLB01F38-001.
               CALL 'ZLB01F38' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZLB01F38 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
